{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30848","headline":"幽上留别令狐侍郎 · 马戴","name":"幽上留别令狐侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自别丘中隐，频年哭路岐。\n辛勤今若是，少壮岂多时。\n露滴阴虫苦，秋声远客悲。\n晚营严鼓角，红叶拂旌旗。\n北阙虚延望，西林久见思。\n川流寒水急，云返故山迟。\n落照游人去，长空独鸟随。\n不堪风景隔，忠信寡相知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}